---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Use"
  description="Terms of access and educational license for the CS Visualizers platform."
  currentRoute="/terms/"
>
  <div class="content-container">
    <header class="page-header">
      <span class="page-badge">LEGAL TERMS</span>
      <h1 class="page-title">TERMS OF USE</h1>
      <p class="page-lead">
        Open educational resource provided free of charge for students and developers worldwide.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="prose-body">
      <section class="prose-section">
        <h2>1. Educational Purpose</h2>
        <p>
          The CS Visualizers platform is provided as a free, open educational resource to assist students, programmers, and software engineers in studying algorithms and computer science concepts.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="prose-section">
        <h2>2. Permitted Use</h2>
        <p>
          You are free to use all visualizers, tools, guides, and cheat sheets for personal learning, academic study, classroom demonstrations, and interview preparation.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="prose-section">
        <h2>3. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
        <p>
          All educational visualizers and developer utilities are provided on an "as is" and "as available" basis without warranties of any kind. While we rigorously test algorithms against edge cases, we encourage verifying all implementations independently.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .content-container {
    max-width: var(--reading-max);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: var(--space-12) var(--gutter);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-8);
  }

  .page-header {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-6);
  }

  .page-badge {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-indigo-400);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-wider);
  }

  .page-title {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 40px);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-tight);
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .page-lead {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .prose-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-8);
  }

  .prose-section {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }

  .prose-section h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .prose-section p {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }
</style>
